    "text": "<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced> <mrow> <mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow> </mfenced><mfenced> <mrow> <mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/7b3df58d-1db2-402f-a0bf-3e6f24c15781.png\" style=\"width:1.92708in;height:0.54028in\" /><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>→</mo></math> point of local maxima,<br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>→</mo></math> point of local minima,<br />Increasing function in <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>∪</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Decreasing function in <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/54edf991-afa5-4f4d-b9b2-50d20d9e00d3.png\" style=\"width:1.81319in;height:1.42708in\" /><br />Also, <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1,2</mn></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mi>α</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mi>β</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mi>γ</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
